The legal text is the Constitution of India, as published by the Legislative Department (Official Languages Wing),
Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India:

  The Constitution of India [As on 1st May, 2024]
  Source: https://legislative.gov.in/constitution-of-india/
  File: https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s380537a945c7aaa788ccfcdf1b99b5d8f/uploads/2024/07/20240716890312078.pdf
  Retrieved 29 October 2026.

The Constitution is the law of India and the text is published by the Government of India for public use.
This repository makes no claim over it.

Changes made by Lexifina: the PDF's text layer was read, split into one Markdown file per article, page headers
and footnotes were removed, amendment footnote markers were stripped, and lines were rejoined into paragraphs.
The wording is otherwise the Government's. Not an official copy.

The Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023 (Act 45 of 2023) is the law of India, as published in The Gazette of India,
Extraordinary, Part II, Section 1, No. 53 (25 December 2023) by the Ministry of Law and Justice (Legislative Department):
  Source: https://egazette.gov.in/WriteReadData/2023/250883.pdf
  Retrieved 30 October 2026.
The file carries no licence statement; the Act is published by the Government of India for general information.
Changes made by Lexifina: the English text layer was read, split into one Markdown file per section, running headers,
page numbers and the marginal notes were removed, and lines were rejoined into paragraphs. Not an official copy.

The Companies Act, 2013 (Act 18 of 2013) is the law of India, as published in The Gazette of India, Extraordinary,
Part II, Section 1 (30 August 2013) by the Ministry of Law and Justice (Legislative Department):
  Source: https://egazette.gov.in/WriteReadData/2013/E_27_2013_425.pdf
  Retrieved 30 October 2026.
The file carries no licence statement; the Act is published by the Government of India for general information.
Changes made by Lexifina: the English text layer was read, split into one Markdown file per section (Sections 1 to 470),
running headers, page numbers and the marginal notes were removed, and lines were rejoined into paragraphs. The Schedules
are not included. Not an official copy.
